<body>
  <h1>Error response</h1>
  <p><strong>Error code:</strong> 404</p>
  <p><strong>Message:</strong> Not Found.</p>
  <p><strong>Error code explanation:</strong> 404 - Nothing matches the given URI.</p>
</body>
